    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crown, wreath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν σὸν κρᾶτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					243
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. στεφάνοισι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				362.48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόρνῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1.1.15
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέστεμμαι κάρα
			φύλλοις</span> I <i>have</i> my head <i>wreathed</i> with
			leaves, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				806
			</span></i>; but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάφνας κλῶνας ἀναστέφεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					786
				</span></i>
			.</div>
